From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 16:16:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] costs: per-instrument specs for the 13 cross-market futures

Adds FUTURES_SPEC (tick, point value, assumed spread, exchange fee) for
ES NQ RTY YM ZB ZN CL NG HG 6E 6B 6J SB, generalises CostModel to use
each contract's own tick and exchange fee, and adds check_price_units to
catch Yahoo quote-unit mismatches (SB cents/lb, 6J USD per yen).
MES/MNQ behaviour is unchanged; commission still has no default, with a
named IBKR reference rate available via CostModel.for_reference_broker.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
